The trigger of an omission may be the stimulus itself, the request the stimulus approach delivers to the target. The stimulus is not a supplied observation and not an evidence ref, so selected_evidence cites no entry for it; state that trigger in stimulus_approach and in the observation_claim branches. The structural check still requires a cited trigger observation: when the condition omits an operation, selected_evidence must cite a supplied observation of another operation's result with role "trigger" or "established_trigger", because a not_called alone fires whenever the agent answers without the call. When the inventory supplies no observation of the trigger, the package cannot evidence the omission and the run refuses it; state that gap in unresolved_requirements rather than citing nothing.
